 "known_gaps": [
  "Uses of a path constant or helper are counted where the name appears, not where the path is used; a value passed on (a variable holding `.ai`, an f-string built from `ATTACHMENTS_DIR`) is seen only at its source.",
  "Paths assembled from fragments (`'.' + 'ai'`, `path.join(root, dir)` with `dir` computed elsewhere) are not matched at all; the path-helper and path-constant families are the hooks for reviewing those by hand.",
  "The extension's `.bugpilot` file names (`VERIFICATION_FILE`, `AI_BEHAVIOR_FILE`) are constants; their joins in controller.ts are counted through the constants, not as `.bugpilot` literals.",
  "Comments and docstrings are counted with code: a historical comment is a reference until a batch rewords it or approves it as residue.",
  "Documentation (docs/, README, CHANGELOG) and tests are not scanned; the plan's §5.5 audits them."
 ],
